    <schema:description>Sandra Agcaoili is a Filipino Licensed Agriculturist registered with the Professional Regulation Commission (PRC) of the Philippines, based in Singapore, with a BS in Agriculture (UP, 2005–2009) and a PhD in Artificial Intelligence in progress at UP Diliman (2023–present). She is Research Partner at Balmores Lab and previously held animal-nutrition roles at Zagro Singapore, Alpha Multitrade (Feedconcept), and Glenwood Technologies International.</schema:description>
